 1792	424A					; UPDATE_VBLANK_FLAG - For interrupt dispatcher use only
 1793	424A					; ==================================================================
 1794	424A					; Register Contract:
 1795	424A					;   Purpose: Read VDP status register and latch VBlank state in RAM flag.
