 6633	55DC					    ; entity_job_should_run_c
 6634	55DC					    ; Evaluate per-entity cadence gate for current frame.
 6635	55DC					    ; Input:  C = entity index (0..31)
 6636	55DC					    ; Output: A = 1 when entity should run this frame, 0 otherwise
 6637	55DC					    ; Destroys: AF, BC, DE, HL
 6638	55DC					    ; Notes:
 6639	55DC					    ;   - Fast path for power-of-two periods using bitmask modulo.
 6640	55DC					    ;   - Fallback path uses 16-bit frame modulo with fixed 16-iteration cost.
