 13042	9A2B					; Redraw all visible tiles based on camera position
 13043	9A2B					; This is the simple (slow) version that redraws everything
 13044	9A2B					; ------------------------------------------------------------------
 13045	9A2B					redraw_viewport:
 13046	9A2B					    ; TODO: Implement full viewport redraw
 13047	9A2B					    ; For each visible tile (32x24):
 13048	9A2B					    ;   1. Calculate world tile coords (camera_tile + screen offset)
 13049	9A2B					    ;   2. Read tile ID from world map
 13050	9A2B					    ;   3. Write tile ID to Name Table
 13051	9A2B					
 13052	9A2B					    ; Placeholder: Just return for now
 13053	9A2B	C9				    ret
